<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Deltarune - Personagens</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🌙 Deltarune - Personagens Principais</h1>
    <p>Conheça os heróis dessa jornada incrível!</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="personagem" id="kris">
      <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/deltarune/images/4/4f/Kris_Battle_Portrait.png" alt="Kris">
      <h2>Kris</h2>
      <p>The first Hero. the cage with soul and parts</p>
    </section>

    <section class="personagem" id="susie">
      <img src="" alt="Susie">
      <h2>Susie</h2>
      <p>And last, was the Girl. at last was the Girl</p>
    </section>

    <section class="personagem" id="ralsei">
      <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/deltarune/images/5/5e/Ralsei_Battle_Portrait.png" alt="Ralsei">
      <h2>Ralsei</h2>
      <p>The third Hero. The prince, alone in deepest dark</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Feito por um fã de Deltarune 💫</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
